  "details": "VRChat asked and the community replied, people want filters because they do NOT want to engage with that content since it cannot be fully removed at this point.\n\nThis response about AI labels is not only absurd but it feels like they are choosing this for the possible reasons:\n\n- Investors that want to push AI slop\n\n- Events/Collabs that end up using AI loses big numbers\n\n- Catering to the Japanese side that likes AI slop\n\n- AI Generated Assets on Store\n\nWe all know Tupper and other VRC Staff loves AI slop from the recent posts, but this platform only existed because of creators from the start, ignoring all human work to cater feels like a total disrespect with the community.\n\nAs for users, please protest by cancelling your VRC+ subscription and be loud about it in-game. We cannot lose this fight",
